# The generator emits LF on every platform (tools/gen_lv_api.py), so pin these
# so a Windows checkout cannot reintroduce CRLF and make a regeneration look
# like a diff. Without this, "regenerating changes nothing" is only true on
# whichever machine last ran the generator.
include/onewili_lv_api.h  text eol=lf
src/onewili_lv_api.c      text eol=lf
onewili_lv.def            text eol=lf
docs/commands.md          text eol=lf

# Hand-written sources, kept LF for the same reason: the test suite compares
# bytes, and the POSIX build path has to see the same files.
*.c    text eol=lf
*.h    text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf

# PowerShell is happier with CRLF on Windows and this one never leaves it.
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
